WEBVTT

00:00:08.239 --> 00:00:10.975
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> How long has she been afraid of dogs?

00:00:20.908 --> 00:00:24.184
She’s been afraid of dogs since she was a baby.

00:00:30.203 --> 00:00:32.522
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> How long has she been a teacher?

00:00:44.422 --> 00:00:47.252
She’s been a teacher since 2020.

00:00:55.032 --> 00:00:57.138
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> How long has she had her car?

00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:11.215
She’s had her car for two weeks.

00:01:15.957 --> 00:01:18.068
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> How long have they lived in this flat?

00:01:28.542 --> 00:01:31.012
They’ve lived in this flat since last week.

00:01:38.296 --> 00:01:40.293
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> How long has he worked here?

00:01:50.645 --> 00:01:53.048
He’s worked here for six months.

00:02:00.107 --> 00:02:02.257
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> How long has he known his girlfriend?

00:02:11.758 --> 00:02:14.114
He’s known his girlfriend for two years.

00:02:20.407 --> 00:02:22.575
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> How long have they had their cat?

00:02:30.861 --> 00:02:33.344
They’ve had their cat for three weeks.

00:02:39.521 --> 00:02:41.371
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> How long has she been ill?

00:02:50.389 --> 00:02:52.500
She’s been ill since Wednesday.